Adapted items (src/aeronexus):
- providers.py: regional Public Cloud gateways incl. the EU gateway, OpenAPI v0.1 paths
- read_only_transport.py: HTTP/business error classes, request-id reporting,
  GET retry/backoff policy honouring Retry-After
- flight hub list parsers: tolerance for {"list": null} empty collections
- flighthub_hms.py: HMS endpoint usage
Only read-only functionality was adopted; no write or flight-control operations.
